{
	"name": "Ceaseless Trudging",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/equipment/feet/boots-collared-rounded-leather.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Once per day, you may choose up to 5 creatures within 30ft. These creatures can ignore fatigue while engaging in normal overland travel for up to 8 hours.</p><p>Alternatively, you can use this ability to engage in a forced march. When you do so, none of the chosen creatures make Constitution saving throws for up to 8 hours of forced march. At the end of the march, however, they must make a Constitution saving throw with a DC of 10 plus the number of hours marched. On a failed save they gain fatigue equal to half the number of hours marched.</p>",
